    "terrainName": "test-town",
    "description": "What: two FPV drones hunt two M1 tanks on test-town. 'Drone A' attacks 'Tank by the deck' at (300, 60); 'Drone B' attacks 'Tank in the open' at (150, 40). The first tank hears the rotors and backs under Garage Deck 1 so its drone's dive meets the slab; the second has no cover. Judge: (1) the deck tank moves under the deck (x 240-290, y 40-80) (2) Drone A is spent and the deck took the warhead - the tank was under it and keeps 90%+ of its health (3000 to 3000 measured) (3) Drone B is spent and the open tank is hit from above (3000 to 2550 measured). Fail: the deck tank is hit, or the open tank is unhurt. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch ua-drone-shelter"
